rast for readability.\"},\n    {\"category\": \"missing_semantics_role\", \"line_hint\": \"DialogHeader.titleColor\", \"why\": \"The title color is not explicitly set.  The default color scheme does not provide sufficient contrast for readability.\"},\n    {\"category\": \"missing_state_description\", \"line_hint\": \"DialogHeader.titleColor\", \"why\": \"The title color is not explicitly set.  The default color scheme does not provide sufficient contrast for readability.\"},\n    {\"category\": \"pointerinput_no_semantics\", \"line_hint\": \"DialogHeader.titleColor\", \"why\": \"The title color is not explicitly set.  The default color scheme does not provide sufficient contrast for readability.\"},\n    {\"category\": \"progress_no_semantics\", \"line_hint\": \"DialogHeader.titleColor\", \"why\": \"The title color is not explicitly set.  The default color scheme does not provide sufficient contrast for readability.\"},\n    {\"category\": \"text_truncation_scaling\", \"line_hint\": \"DialogHeader.titleColor\", \"why\": \"The title color is not explicitly set.  The default color scheme does not provide sufficient contrast for readability.\"},\n    {\"category\": \"textfield_no_label\", \"line_hint\": \"DialogHeader.titleColor\", \"why\": \"The title color is not explicitly set.  The default color scheme does not provide sufficient contrast for readability.\"},\n    {\"category\": \"touch_target_size\", \"line_hint\": \"DialogHeader.titleColor\", \"why\": \"The title color is not explicitly set.  The default color scheme does not provide sufficient contrast for readability.\"}\n  ]\n}", "parsed": {"has_issue": true, "issues": [{"category": "clickable_icon_not_iconbutton", "line_hint": "TextButton.on_click", "why": "The TextButton's icon is not automatically displayed.  The default icon is not visible when the button is clicked."}, {"category": "color_contrast", "line_hint": "DialogHeader.titleColor", "why": "The title color is not explicitly set.  The default color 