roperly handled.", "why": "The error state is not handled correctly, potentially leading to a confusing user experience."}, {"category": "missing_content_description", "line_hint": "Missing content description.", "why": "The content description is missing, making it difficult to understand the purpose of the component."}, {"category": "missing_heading_semantics", "line_hint": "Missing heading semantics.", "why": "The heading semantics are missing, making it difficult to understand the purpose of the component."}, {"category": "missing_interaction_semantics", "line_hint": "Missing interaction semantics.", "why": "The interaction semantics are missing, making it difficult to understand how the component is used."}, {"category": "missing_merge_descendants", "line_hint": "Merge descendants are missing.", "why": "Merge descendants are missing, potentially causing unexpected behavior."}, {"category": "missing_semantics_role", "line_hint": "Semantics role is missing.", "why": "The semantics role is missing, making it difficult to understand the component's purpose."}, {"category": "missing_state_description", "line_hint": "State description is missing.", "why": "The state description is missing, making it difficult to understand the component's state."}, {"category": "pointerinput_no_semantics", "line_hint": "Pointer input has no semantics.", "why": "Pointer input does not have semantic information, making it difficult to use."}, {"category": "progress_no_semantics", "line_hint": "Progress indicator has no semantics.", "why": "Progress indicator does not have semantic information, making it difficult to understand progress."}, {"category": "text_truncation_scaling", "line_hint": "Text truncation scaling is not applied.", "why": "Text truncation scaling is not applied, potentially leading to text being truncated."}, {"category": "textfield_no_label", "line_hint": "Textfield lacks a label.", "why": "Textfield lacks a label, making it difficult to identify the field."}, {"cat